cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference the VarCat Demonstration Platform, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "VarCat Demonstration Platform"
type: software
abstract: >-
  The VarCat Demonstration Platform is an upcoming web-based demonstration of
  the Variation Categorizer (VarCat) workflow for structured pediatric somatic
  cancer variant classification. The platform will show how VarCat supports the
  application of community somatic variant classification guidelines and enables
  GA4GH-compliant dissemination of pediatric somatic cancer variant knowledge.
  This repository serves as a landing page for documentation, citation metadata,
  and links related to the demonstration platform. The demo site landing page
  will be available at https://demo.varcat.genomicmedlab.org.
